Sampung taon?

00:45:41.676 --> 00:45:42.718
- Pakiusap.
- Bitawan mo!

00:45:42.969 --> 00:45:45.346
Si Jang Tae-sik ay
isa pa ring may-ari ng S Shopping ngayon.

00:45:45.513 --> 00:45:48.516
